      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "White card with a hairline title row and hairline-separated metric cells.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><h2 class=\"ds-card-title\">Body</h2><div class=\"ds-cells\"><div class=\"ds-cell\"><div class=\"ds-cell-label\">Resting heart rate</div><div><span class=\"ds-num\">58</span> <span class=\"ds-unit\">bpm</span></div><div class=\"ds-cell-sub\">Your normal: 56 bpm</div></div><div class=\"ds-cell ds-cell-warn\"><div class=\"ds-cell-label\">Intraocular pressure <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M7 1.2 13 12.4H1Z\" fill=\"rgb(var(--warn))\"/></svg></div><div><span class=\"ds-num\">21</span> <span class=\"ds-unit\">mmHg</span></div><div class=\"ds-cell-sub\">Watch</div></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;border:1px solid rgb(var(--ink-700));border-radius:24px;background:rgb(var(--ink-900));color:rgb(var(--fg));padding:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);transition:transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1),box-shadow 200ms}.ds-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);border-color:rgb(var(--ink-600))}.ds-card-title{margin:0 0 16px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(var(--ink-700));font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.015em}.ds-cells{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.ds-cell{border-top:1px solid rgb(var(--ink-700));padding-top:12px}.ds-cell-warn{border-top:2px solid rgb(var(--warn))}.ds-cell-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgb(var(--slate-400))}.ds-num{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.025em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-unit{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:rgb(var(--slate-400))}.ds-cell-sub{margin-top:4px;font-size:12px;color:rgb(var(--slate-400))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Watch Alert",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "alert-tile-warn",
      "description": "An alert tile: shape, title, the reason, then the first thing to do.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-alert\"><div class=\"ds-alert-title\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M7 1.2 13 12.4H1Z\" fill=\"rgb(var(--warn))\"/></svg>Fluid intake low</div><p class=\"ds-alert-why\"><b>Why:</b> 1.4 L of 2.5 L by mid-day.</p><p class=\"ds-alert-rec\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>Drink 500 mL in the next hour.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-alert{font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;border:1px solid rgb(var(--warn) / 0.45);border-radius:18px;background:rgb(var(--warn-soft));padding:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);color:rgb(var(--fg))}.ds-alert-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700}.ds-alert-why{margin:6px 0 0;color:rgb(var(--slate-300))}.ds-alert-why b{color:rgb(var(--fg))}.ds-alert-rec{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:flex-start;margin:6px 0 0;font-weight:600;color:rgb(var(--accent))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Pill",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-pill-warn",
      "description": "State as shape + word + colour.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-ok\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>Normal</span> <span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-warn\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M7 1.2 13 12.4H1Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>Watch</span> <span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-bad\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M7 .8 13.2 7 7 13.2.8 7Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>Act now</span>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:9999px;border:1px solid;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-pill-ok{background:rgb(var(--ok) / 0.15);border-color:rgb(var(--ok) / 0.4);color:rgb(var(--ok))}.ds-pill-warn{background:rgb(var(--warn) / 0.15);border-color:rgb(var(--warn) / 0.4);color:rgb(var(--warn))}.ds-pill-bad{background:rgb(var(--bad) / 0.15);border-color:rgb(var(--bad) / 0.5);color:rgb(var(--bad))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Side Rail Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item-active",
      "description": "Pill nav items with authored 2px icons; active on atmosphere-blue-soft.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item ds-active\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3v2M12 19v2M3 12h2M19 12h2M5.6 5.6l1.4 1.4M17 17l1.4 1.4M5.6 18.4 7 17M17 7l1.4-1.4M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8z\"/></svg>Today</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 20s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z\"/></svg>Body</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;width:240px;padding:16px 12px;background:rgb(var(--ink-900));border-right:1px solid rgb(var(--ink-700))}.ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:46px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:9999px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:rgb(var(--slate-400));text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:rgb(var(--ink-850));color:rgb(var(--fg))}.ds-nav-item.ds-active{background:rgb(var(--accent-soft));color:rgb(var(--accent))}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid rgb(var(--accent));outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "seg-option-selected",
      "description": "Range and view switches; the selected option inverts to ink.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button class=\"ds-seg-opt ds-on\" aria-pressed=\"true\">7 days</button><button class=\"ds-seg-opt\" aria-pressed=\"false\">30 days</button><button class=\"ds-seg-opt\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Mission</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;gap:4px;padding:4px;border:1px solid rgb(var(--ink-700));border-radius:9999px;background:rgb(var(--ink-850))}.ds-seg-opt{min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border:none;border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;color:rgb(var(--slate-300));font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms}.ds-seg-opt:hover{background:rgb(var(--ink-700))}.ds-seg-opt.ds-on{background:rgb(var(--fg));color:rgb(var(--ink-950));font-weight:700}.ds-seg-opt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid rgb(var(--accent));outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Limb Line",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "limb-line",
      "description": "Signature: the header's bottom edge, with the mission-progress point.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-limb\" style=\"--limb-pos:38%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mission progress 37%\"></div>",
      "css": ".ds-limb{position:relative;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(127,196,245,0) 0%,rgba(127,196,245,0.85) 12%,#7FC4F5 50%,rgba(127,196,245,0.85) 88%,rgba(127,196,245,0) 100%);box-shadow:0 1px 8px rgba(127,196,245,0.55)}.ds-limb::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:50%;left:var(--limb-pos,50%);width:9px;height:9px;margin:-4.5px 0 0 -4.5px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgb(var(--accent)),0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);transition:left 900ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-limb::after{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Cupola Window",
    "overview": "The app is lit like the ISS cupola looking down at Earth. In daylight (Cupola Daylight, the default light theme) that means a cloud-white ground, pure white cards and ocean-navy ink. At night (Cupola Night, the dark theme) it is the station over Earth's night side: deep ocean navy ground, cards one step lighter, pale ink. Both themes are one system. Every colour is a CSS variable holding `R G B`, defined once per theme, and every component reads the same semantic names, so a screen built for one theme is correct in the other without edits. The theme follows the operating system until the person picks one with the round switch in the header. The choice is stored and applied before first paint.\n\nOne thing holds the world together: the **atmosphere limb line**, a thin pale-blue glow (3px) along the bottom edge of every header. A bright white point travels along it from launch to landing, so the line doubles as mission progress. On the login screen the same line becomes the full curved Earth limb, and the crew card is read on it.\n\nDensity is calm but data-rich. Structure comes from 1px hairlines and quiet tonal steps, not boxes inside boxes. One family, Public Sans, carries both display and data, always with tabular numerals. Every health state is readable without colour: it always has a shape and a word as well.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Two themes, one token set: Cupola Daylight (light) and Cupola Night (dark), switched by `data-theme` on the root.",
      "A single atmosphere blue for the primary action, selection and focus. Its rarity is the point.",
      "The limb line under every header, doubling as mission progress.",
      "Hairline metric cells instead of boxed tiles. Generous 24px card corners, pill-shaped controls.",
      "States as shape + word + colour: circle = normal, triangle = watch, diamond = act now.",
      "Soft, navy-tinted (light) or black (dark) ambient shadows. Nothing hard-edged."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Atmosphere Rule",
        "body": "Atmosphere Blue marks the single primary action, the current location and focus. Nothing decorative is blue-filled.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Never-Colour-Alone Rule",
        "body": "A state colour is always paired with a shape (circle / triangle / diamond) and a word (\"Normal\", \"Watch\", \"Act now\"). A metric cell on watch or act-now also thickens its top hairline to 2px in the state colour.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Same-Names Rule",
        "body": "Components use the semantic tokens (ground, card, soft tile, well, hairline, ink, state), never a literal hex. Charts and SVG, which cannot read CSS variables, read the theme's current values through the `C` getters and `themePalette()` in `lib/theme.tsx`, which hold exactly the hexes above for each theme. The one place literal colour is allowed is the login's Earth and anything drawn on it, which stays the same in both themes because Earth is always ocean.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Family Rule",
        "body": "Public Sans only. No second display face, no system fallback chosen as a look.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Rule",
        "body": "Numerals are tabular everywhere (set on `body` and on tables), so values in a column and a ticking mission clock never jitter.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Soft-Light Rule",
        "body": "Every shadow is diffuse and offset downward with a negative spread. No hard offset shadows, no inner shadows.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** build every surface from the semantic tokens (ground, card, soft tile, well, hairline, ink, state) so it is correct in both Cupola Daylight and Cupola Night.",
      "**Do** give every SVG or chart colour through `C` / `themePalette()`, never a hardcoded hex.",
      "**Do** close every header with the limb line and keep its progress point.",
      "**Do** pair every state colour with its shape (circle, triangle, diamond) and a word.",
      "**Do** separate metrics with hairlines (1px top rule) inside a card rather than nesting boxed tiles.",
      "**Do** keep touch targets at least 44px and buttons at least 48px tall.",
      "**Do** use tabular numerals for every value and clock."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use a dark starfield, neon glow or sci-fi dashboard look. The night theme is a calm navy ocean, not space.",
      "**Don't** add a second accent colour or fill decorative elements with Atmosphere Blue.",
      "**Don't** use Sun Amber or Limb Blue for text or as a status colour.",
      "**Don't** use hard offset shadows, inner shadows or black outlines.",
      "**Don't** add uppercase eyebrows or letter-spaced kickers above headings.",
      "**Don't** use emoji or icon fonts as icons; use the authored 2px-stroke set.",
      "**Don't** fetch fonts from the network; Public Sans is bundled."
    ]
  }
}